      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>“An American Covenant of Brotherhood” was first published in Rabbi Mordecai Kaplan’s <tei:hi rend="italic">A Sabbath Prayer Book</tei:hi> (Jewish Reconstructionist Foundation, 1945), p. 538-541. (A slightly modified version was published under the title “The Spiritual Heritage of America” in <tei:hi rend="italic">The Faith of America: Readings, Songs, and Prayers for the Celebration of American Holidays</tei:hi> (Jewish Reconstructionist Foundation 1951), p. 65-67.) I have replaced all archaisms (Thee, Thy, Thou) in reference to divinity. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
